SUMMARY:In The Other Room: King Bo
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Alpharetta
DESCRIPTION:King Bo is a stand-up comedian and digital creator known for hi
 s fearless storytelling\, high energy delivery\, and wildly relatable takes
  on dating\, friendships\, and everyday chaos. His comedy blends sharp obse
 rvations with real-life experiences\, delivered with a larger-than life per
 sonality that has made him a favorite both online and on stage.\n\nBo first
  gained widespread attention through viral comedy sketches and character-dr
 iven videos that quickly built him a loyal fanbase of millions across socia
 l media. What started as digital momentum has rapidly translated into a gro
 wing live audience\, with Bo performing to sold-out crowds at venues across
  the country including headline shows at The Lodge Room in Los Angeles and 
 City Winery.\n\nWhether on stage or on screen\, Bo’s comedy is rooted in 
 honesty\, quick wit\, and the kind of storytelling that leaves audiences fe
 eling like they’ve just spent the night laughing with a friend. With a ra
 pidly expanding touring footprint and a massive digital following\, King Bo
  is emerging as one of the most exciting new comedians bridging the worlds 
 of stand-up and digital entertainment.\n\nThere is a two-item per person mi
 nimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drink items
  from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lo
 unge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the 
 right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem disrupt
 ive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/come
 dy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room-king-bo/
